- `ga_modules_*` — module-specific state
- `ga_retrievals_*` — retrieval submission records
- `ga_subunit_flags_*` — sub-unit completion flags
- `ga_imbuement_*` — module imbuement saturation
- `ga_welcome_flags` — first-visit flags
