## CACHE CONSIDERATIONS FOR GITHUB PAGES

The live site is hosted on GitHub Pages at ascension-1.live. Changes pushed to `main` deploy automatically but may take a few minutes to propagate. Browser cache and CDN cache can delay visibility further.

When verifying production changes:
- Hard reload bypasses browser cache but not CDN cache
- Use a private/incognito window or different browser to test fresh
- Wait 2-5 minutes after push before assuming the change isn't live
- Check the deployed file's actual contents via `view-source:` if behavior seems stale

